IC002 warning oci-archive:golden-image
  1 extracted package-cache entries remain in the final image.
  Next: Prefer copying a tested application prefix into a compatible runtime stage. Extracted caches can supply required symlink or hardlink targets; do not remove them without validating dependency and relocation behavior. Logical payload bytes are not unique or reclaimable bytes.
