IC004 warning oci-archive:golden-image
  1 hidden or replaced cache references remain in final-image referenced layers.
  Next: Review same-step build-time cleanup, BuildKit cache mounts, or a dedicated compatible runtime stage. A later deletion does not remove earlier referenced layer content. Compressed descriptor sizes describe complete layers, not per-file savings; this evidence does not identify Dockerfile instructions or unrelated builder stages.
