IC006 warning oci-archive:golden-image
  1 OS package-manager command identities are confirmed in the final image.
  Next: For declared runtime images, review keeping installation commands in the builder stage and copying tested runtime contents into a compatible final image. Intentional package-management workloads may retain them. Preserve package databases, conda metadata and shared runtime libraries for behavior and scanner visibility; removing evidence is not vulnerability remediation.
